Subject: [PATCH] fix(post): honor or refuse G83 dwell per control

Refuse unsupported G83 dwell on Fanuc, Doosan and Mazak.
Keep Haas dwell modal state accurate, including explicit zero reset.

Co-Authored-By: OpenAI Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #1820
